Attribution
-----------

Skopos is built on ARTEX, an autonomous AI penetration-testing system by
Autumn-27, from which this project derives its code and architecture:

    ARTEX        https://github.com/Autumn-27/ARTEX        (AGPL-3.0)

Skopos descends from the intermediate "ScopeWeaver" derivative of ARTEX:

    ScopeWeaver  https://github.com/cskwork/scopeweaver

Additional upstream components credited:

    norma SDK    https://github.com/Autumn-27/norma         (agent capabilities)
    ScopeSentry  https://github.com/Autumn-27/ScopeSentry    (asset-sync concepts)

Several skill files under skills/ are adapted from Dreadnode's capabilities
project (MIT License), commit 52f369eae047ba7a8b6b72d650355e4c6be4ec42:

    capabilities https://github.com/dreadnode/capabilities      (MIT)

See docs/CAPABILITIES-IMPORT-2026-10-22.md for the full list of imported and
adapted skills, and each skill's own SKILL.md for its individual provenance
note.

The original ARTEX copyright, authorship, contributor acknowledgments, and
upstream changelog history are retained and remain attributed to their authors.
This project changes the product name, the user-facing interface and messages,
the documentation, and the distribution targets, and renames ARTEX's internal
identifiers (module path, environment variables, database/login defaults) to
Skopos's own.

